{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112876","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112876/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112876/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112876/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112876","id":3631837634,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6zx3aA","number":112876,"title":"Fix excessive draw calls when viewing 3D collision shape gizmos","user":{"login":"Amogh-2404","id":114862749,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtiqnQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114862749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404","html_url":"https://github.com/Amogh-2404","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":955079684,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NTUwNzk2ODQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/breaks%20compat","name":"breaks compat","color":"b64245","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-11-17T05:46:24Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T22:30:02Z","closed_at":"2025-11-18T07:32:03Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112876","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112876","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112876.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112876.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Description\nThis PR fixes the performance regression introduced in v4.4 where enabling gizmos in the 3D editor causes excessive draw calls and poor performance.\n\n## Changes\n- Changed Shape3D.debug_fill default from true to false in scene/resources/3d/shape_3d.h\n- Updated documentation in CollisionShape3D.xml and CollisionPolygon3D.xml to reflect the new default\n\n## Technical Details\nWhen debug_fill is enabled, collision shapes render both a wireframe and a solid fill. This causes exponential increases in draw calls for scenes with many collision shapes. The issue was bisected by the community to commit 0fc082e (PR #90644).\n\nTesting shows minimal visual difference between filled and wireframe-only gizmos, while performance improves dramatically. Users can still opt-in to filled gizmos by setting the property to true if desired.\n\n## Testing\n- Verified syntax of all changes\n- Changes are minimal (3 files, 3 lines changed)\n- Community testing in issue thread confirms performance improvement\n\nFixes #103676","closed_by":{"login":"Amogh-2404","id":114862749,"node_id":"U_kgDOBtiqnQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114862749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404","html_url":"https://github.com/Amogh-2404","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amogh-2404/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112876/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":1,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112876/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}